Whenever someone remarks "NHINRL" I can generally expect to disagree,
but in this case it's exactly the right response.  Stop egregious
examples of farming, yes, but death drops are an important reward for
killing monsters, and also give extremely unlucky players a slim
chance of getting an item they might need to continue the game.

Lots of the things Nethack does that seem unusual to us are because of
the game's roots in Dungeons & Dragons.  While NHIND&D, this is one of
those things.

